desc=Seeded roguelike deckbuilder: three acts of branching maps (battles, elites, shops, events, campfires, treasure, bosses), 31 cards with poison/weak/vulnerable/strength/exhaust/retain, card upgrades, 17 relics, 17 enemies with telegraphed intents, animated battles and unlockable ascension levels. Same seed always means the same run.
desc.zh=带种子的肉鸽卡牌构筑：三幕分岔地图（战斗、精英、商店、奇遇、篝火、宝箱、Boss），31 张牌含中毒/虚弱/易伤/力量/消耗/保留，篝火升级、17 件遗物、17 种亮出意图的敌人、带飞牌与跳字的战斗演出，登顶解锁进阶难度。同一颗种子必然是同一局。
